{ "Set by XeFG: the game's own keeps its XeLL (only the FPS limit is OptiScaler's)", "Nustato XeFG: paties žaidimo variantas išlaiko savo XeLL (tik FPS riba yra OptiScaler)" },
{ "Sets ApplyAfterRR to false; danielblnc then runs before Super Resolution / Ray\nReconstruction too, if you switch back to it.", "Nustato ApplyAfterRR į false; tada danielblnc irgi veikia prieš Super Resolution / Ray\nReconstruction, jei į jį grįšite." },
