{ "Such an aggressive upscaling? A bold move", "Toks agresyvus upscalinimas? Drąsus ėjimas" },
{ "Supersampling %.2fx: the model runs ABOVE native, then\nis sampled back down. Experimental, and costly -- time grows with the area.", "Supersampling %.2fx: modelis veikia VIRŠ natyvios raiškos, tada\nsumažinamas atgal. Eksperimentinis ir brangus -- laikas auga su plotu." },
