{ "This upscaler belongs in a museum!", "Šio upscalerio vieta muziejuje!" },
{ "This usually happens due to using tools\nsuch as Nvidia App or Nvidia Inspector", "Paprastai taip nutinka naudojant įrankius,\ntokius kaip Nvidia App arba Nvidia Inspector" },
{ "Three is the ceiling: one runtime module per pass.", "Trys yra lubos: vienas runtime modulis praėjimui." },
